        <mxCell id="c39" value="&lt;b&gt;Model answer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(2) The role&#x27;s script, as TMDL view&#x27;s Apply leaves it,&lt;br&gt;is the TMDL view tab Ex B.1: the role&#x27;s&lt;br&gt;tablePermission rules are kept, and …&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(3) As the Production Manager (View as, Other user&lt;br&gt;employee004@charlesriver.example, role Cost&lt;br&gt;Center Managers), the table on this page fails: …&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(4) Performance analyzer durations vary by machine;&lt;br&gt;expect slightly longer durations under View as,&lt;br&gt;because every query carries the role&#x27;s filters.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(5) Row-level security restricts rows, not columns:&lt;br&gt;the managers must see the plant&#x27;s employees and&lt;br&gt;their hours, so the rows stay and only the column is …" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525" y="56" width="319" height="324" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
